   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sponsoring school fees for young people in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Adote project was created as a solution to help children study in private schools. By &quot;adopting&quot; a child&apos;s education, the Adote project directs the funds donated to pay school fees at private schools. In 2022, the Adote project grew to include young university students looking for support to take the next step and find a dignified life for their families.</narrative>
  </description>
